[[Celtic F.C.|Celtic]] started the 2001–02 season looking to retain the [[Scottish Premier League]], [[Scottish League Cup]] and the [[Scottish Cup]]. They entered the [[UEFA Champions League]] at the third qualifying round. They finished the season as league champions for the second season in succession.

